ithub.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90226), which was originally merged on March 19 2024.\r\n\r\n# Original Description\r\n\r\nAllows the user to bind a shortcut to open and focus on the side docks.\r\nDidn't set any defaults, but I can if wanted.\r\nThe tab of the dock will be selected, you can use ui_focus_next (Tab) to go to other focusable parts of the dock that you want.\r\nAvailable as commands in the command palette.\r\n\r\nAlso updated the EditorPlugin add_control_to_dock documentation and removed the part about bottom panel since users can not use this to make docks that can go to the bottom panel (Unless I'm missing something?).\r\n\r\n![](https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10054226/319785124-e10b1748-7d09-4abf-af3f-c91662e98dba.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..RsZG5oZoCdK9CUYZOzCmnCY5_-cgglOF5Bn7uh3hoqk)\r\n\r\nThe Filesystem shortcut already exists under Bottom Panels.","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-05-26T04:48:28Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:37:32Z","closed_at":"2025-05-26T04:57:35Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"garettbass:garettbass/master/dock-shortcuts","ref":"garettbass/master/dock-shortcuts","repo":{"id":990405413,"node_id":"R_kgDOOwhjJQ","name":"godot","full_name":"garettbass/godot","owner":{"login":"garettbass","id":561106,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEwNg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/561106?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/garettbass","html_url":"https://github.com/garettbass","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garettbass/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garettbass